# Reviewed scope opt-outs (decisions-T20 #16, Test C: TestQueriesDeclareScope).
#
# One line per query or Go SQL declaration: "<tag> <file> <name>". A query
# tagged own, org, admin, system, pending or resolved is listed here, so a new
# one needs review. team, project and feed queries carry the predicate and are not
# listed; none queries name no tenant table (Test C checks it) and are not
# listed. pending: a later build ticket of the note scopes the query and moves
# it to team or project, and removes its line here.
#
# Sorted by tag, then file, then name.
